      "content": [
        {
          "type": "text",
          "text": "Modernising Catalogue Search for a Public Library"
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "type": "paragraph",
      "content": [
        {
          "type": "text",
          "text": "A fictional library moved catalogue search to a hosted service and reports qualitative benefits."
        },
        {
          "type": "sourceCitation",
          "attrs": {
            "sourceChunkId": "2996d674-05b3-4b7d-841a-a697dc13cf53"
          }
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "type": "heading",
      "attrs": {
        "level": 2
      },
      "content": [
        {
          "type": "text",
          "text": "Results and Impact"
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "type": "paragraph",
      "content": [
        {
          "type": "text",
          "text": "Staff describe search as easier to use, and patrons ask for help less often."
        },
        {
          "type": "sourceCitation",
          "attrs": {
            "sourceChunkId": "2996d674-05b3-4b7d-841a-a697dc13cf53"
          }
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "type": "paragraph",
      "content": [
        {
          "type": "text",
          "text": "No volume, cost or time figures were recorded for the change."
        },
        {
          "type": "sourceCitation",
          "attrs": {
            "sourceChunkId": "e86b43a0-7743-4ca8-8160-c0787f0d0a26"
          }
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "type": "heading",
      "attrs": {
        "level": 2
      },
      "content": [
        {
          "type": "text",
          "text": "Conclusion"
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "type": "paragraph",
      "content": [
        {
          "type": "text",
          "text": "The benefits are qualitative; any quantified result would need new measurement."
        },
        {
          "type": "sourceCitation",
          "attrs": {
            "sourceChunkId": "2996d674-05b3-4b7d-841a-a697dc13cf53"
